d the law that's what it is  a Canadian investigation determined  Maher was completely innocent and that  the mistake was based on faulty  intelligence in this country I think we  think of ourselves as this incredibly  free society but I think few Americans  are aware of the fact that there's a  secret justice system where you're not  allowed to know the rules you're not  even allowed to know why you've been put  on a terror watchlist  [Music]  [Music]
 

